Traditional East-Asian ink wash painting (sumi-e) style, black ink on aged off-white rice paper, expressive brush strokes, ink bleeds and splatters, dramatic negative space, a single blood-red accent colour, cinematic horror mood, realistic human anatomy and faces (not cartoon, not anime), Indian setting.
